        "text": "FULL INTERVIEW: Jerry Tworek says AI researchers now tell each other they have a last few days of work left, so work while you still can. He gives it two years before humans stop being a meaningful part of AI research.\n\n@MillionInt spent 7 years at @OpenAI, where he led o1 and o3 https://t.co/jmyPReVdQq",
